        "filing_date": "2026-03-23",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our inability to promptly obtain coverage and profitable reimbursement rates from both government-funded and private payors for any approved products that we develop could have a material adverse effect on our operating results, our ability to raise capital needed to commercialize products and our overall financial condition.",
