        "filing_date": "2026-03-23",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The legislative and regulatory landscape for privacy and data protection continues to evolve, and there has been an increasing focus on privacy and data protection issues that may affect our business, including recently enacted laws in all jurisdictions where we operate.",
